---
title: How a diagram gets made
---
flowchart TD
    A([Your agent describes the diagram]) --> B[Check the description]
    B --> C{Makes sense?}
    C -->|no| X[Tell the agent what to fix]
    C -->|yes| D[Lay out and draw]
    D --> E[Check the drawing]
    E --> F{Anything overlapping?}
    F -- yes --> G[Rearrange]
    G -.-> E
    F ==>|no| H([Finished diagram])
    X -.-> A
